{"html": "<section class=\"section no-top\"><div class=\"container reserve-grid\"><div class=\"form-block w-form\"><form class=\"form\" name=\"contact\" data-name=\"Contact\" method=\"get\"><div class=\"form-field\"><label class=\"form-label\" for=\"c-name\">Name</label><input class=\"input is-light\" id=\"c-name\" name=\"Name\" data-name=\"Name\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"Jane Doe\" required></div><div class=\"form-field\"><label class=\"form-label\" for=\"c-email\">Email</label><input class=\"input is-light\" id=\"c-email\" name=\"Email\" data-name=\"Email\" type=\"email\" placeholder=\"jane@email.com\" required></div><div class=\"form-field is-full\"><label class=\"form-label\" for=\"c-topic\">Topic</label><select class=\"input is-light\" id=\"c-topic\" name=\"Topic\" data-name=\"Topic\"><option value=\"General question\">General question</option><option value=\"Private dining\">Private dining</option><option value=\"Gift cards\">Gift cards</option><option value=\"Press\">Press</option></select></div><div class=\"form-field is-full\"><label class=\"form-label\" for=\"c-msg\">Message</label><textarea class=\"input is-light is-area\" id=\"c-msg\" name=\"Message\" data-name=\"Message\" placeholder=\"Tell us a little more…\"></textarea></div><div class=\"form-field is-full\"><input class=\"button\" type=\"submit\" value=\"Send message\" data-wait=\"Sending...\"></div></form><div class=\"form-success w-form-done\"><div>Thank you! Your message is on its way — we reply within one working day.</div></div><div class=\"form-error w-form-fail\"><div>Something went wrong. Please email us at hello@hanabi.example.</div></div></div><div class=\"info-card\"><div class=\"info-row\"><span class=\"info-label\">Address</span><span class=\"info-value\">48 Harbor Lane<br>Seaside City, 10001</span></div><div class=\"info-row\"><span class=\"info-label\">Phone</span><a href=\"tel:+15550142048\" class=\"info-value\">+1 (555) 014-2048</a></div><div class=\"info-row\"><span class=\"info-label\">Email</span><a href=\"mailto:hello@hanabi.example\" class=\"info-value\">hello@hanabi.example</a></div><a href=\"#\" class=\"button is-ghost-light\">Get directions</a></div></div></section>", "css": ".input.is-light { border-color: rgba(20, 22, 19, 0.16); background-color: #fffdf9; color: #141613; } .input.is-light:focus { border-color: #141613; } .input.is-area { height: 140px; }"}